e/godot/pull/107013.patch","merged_at":"2025-09-24T15:04:33Z"},"body":"Make the node path relative to the target node instead of the source node.\r\n\r\nCurrently, a proxy object is used in the connection dialog to edit bound arguments.\r\n\r\nIn this case, the `EditorPropertyNodePath` will get the node path relative to the source object in the connection (i.e. the object the InspectorDock is editing).\r\n\r\nThis path is not available in scripts (i.e. the target object in the connection).\r\n\r\n<!--\r\nPlease target the `master` branch in priority.\r\n\r\nRelevant fixes are cherry-picked for stable branches as needed by maintainers.\r\n\r\nTo speed up the contribution process and avoid CI errors, please set up pre-commit hooks locally:\r\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/latest/contributing/development/code_style_guidelines.html\r\n-->\r\n\r\nFix #106983, fix #83700.\r\n\r\nhttps://github.com/user-attachments/assets/70d5b5a8-13d5-468b-9dfb-76885a48f22c\r\n\r\n\r\n","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/107013/reac